    "title": "Ratlami Sev | रतलामी सेव | Authentic Indian Spicy Sev",
    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"746\">Experience the <strong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"500\">spicy, crunchy delight of Ratlami Sev</strong>, a traditional<strong> Indian</strong><strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"542\"> namkeen snack</strong> handcrafted by <strong data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"578\">Bhagvat Prasadam</strong>. Made using <strong data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"614\">premium ingredients</strong> and authentic <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"653\">Ratlami spice blends</strong>, this <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"679\">mixture namkeen</strong> delivers an irresistible crunch and rich flavor with every bite.</p>\n<p data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"999\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"842\">prasad offerings, tea-time snacking, festive Diwali treats, or corporate gifting</strong>, our <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"863\">Ratlami Sev</strong> combines <strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"918\">authentic taste, freshness, and tradition</strong> in every pack. Enjoy this <strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"978\">fresh, flavorful Indian snack</strong> anytime, anywhere.</p>",
